# R:Event$ DamageDone | ActiveZones$ Command (an ongoing scheme in Command) prevents 1 of
# the 2 damage an opponent-controlled source would deal to its controller (CR 615).
# Untap -> Upkeep -> Draw -> Main1 -> BeginCombat -> Declare Attackers.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
